OL,3,GNEWSAFamily claims dead man was not
OL,4,A'Putney pusher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man suspected to be the
OL,7,F"Putney pusher" say he was innocent and
OL,8,Fhave blamed his death on pressure of
OL,9,Fthe police investigation into him.
OL,11,FNicholas Brandram, 44, was under
OL,12,Fsuspicion of being the jogger who
OL,13,Fpushed a woman into the path of a bus
OL,14,Fduring a run on Putney Bridge in west
OL,15,FLondon in 2017.
OL,17,FBrandram's family said he "took his own
OL,18,Flife after months of immense pressure
OL,19,Fcaused by a Metropolitan Police
OL,20,Finvestigation" and there was no
OL,21,Fforensic evidence linking the banker to
OL,22,Fthe incident.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
